        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-6xl xl:text-7xl">
          Greater
          <span class="text-brand-primary block">Los Angeles</span>
          Area Mensa
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          Connecting the brightest minds across SoCal. We are a vibrant community of thinkers,
          creators, and innovators rejoicing in the interplay of ideas.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="/join/"
            class="bg-brand-primary hover:shadow-brand-primary/30 inline-flex transform items-center justify-center rounded-full px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-white transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-blue-800 hover:shadow-xl"
          >
            Join Mensa
          </a>
          <a
